{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18393","headline":"赋得风动万年枝 · 樊阳源","name":"赋得风动万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍木罗前殿，乘春任好风。\n振柯方褭褭，舒叶乍蒙蒙。\n影动丹墀上，声传紫禁中。\n离披偏向日，凌乱半分空。\n轻拂祥烟散，低摇翠色同。\n长令占天眷，四气借全功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊阳源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}